---
const { siteName, author, url } = Astro.props;
---

<h1 class="center">Welcome Back to {siteName}!</h1>
<div class="bigbox">
    <figure class="og-logo">
        <img
            src="/images/rocket_comics_logo.png"
            alt="The original Rocket Comics logo."
        />
        <figcaption>The original Rocket Comics logo.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <article>
        <p>
            In 1991, Mack Richardson opened the doors of Rocket Comics in
            Burlington, NC. It was an exciting time to be a comic book fan and,
            <b>doubly so</b>, for those who wanted to share their love of comics with
            others. Mack's shop was a place where fans could gather, talk about
            their favorite characters, and discover new stories. It was a comic
            book shop meant for comic book fans.
        </p>
        <p>
            Even though the shop has been closed for many years now, the spirit
            of Rocket Comics lives on. This site is a tribute to the shop and
            the fans who made it a special place.
        </p>
        <p>
            The comic book industry <i>(and world, at large)</i> has changed so much
            over the last 30 years. In many ways, it seems to be a much more challenging
            environment to successfully operate a comic book shop. That being said,
            plans are in the works to reopen Rocket Comics. <strong
                >Stay tuned!</strong
            >
        </p>
    </article>
    <figure class="handdrawn">
        <img
            src="/images/rocket_comics/rocket_comics_0.webp"
            alt="An early advertisement for Rocket Comics in the Burlington-Times News."
        />
        <figcaption>
            An early advertisement for Rocket Comics in the Burlington-Times
            News.
        </figcaption>
    </figure>
</div>

<style lang="css">
    .og-logo::after {
        display: none;
    }
    /* ------------------------------------------------------------
   BIGBOX LAYOUT
   Mobile-first: stacked
------------------------------------------------------------- */

    .bigbox {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        max-width: 90rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* Images behave nicely */
    .bigbox img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
    }

    /* Keep captions readable but subtle */
    .bigbox figcaption {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        opacity: 0.8;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .bigbox figure.handdrawn figcaption {
        opacity: 1;
        margin: 0;
    }

    /* ------------------------------------------------------------
   Widescreen: 3-column layout
------------------------------------------------------------- */

    @media (min-width: 64rem) {
        .bigbox {
            flex-direction: row;
        }

        .bigbox > figure {
            flex: 1 1 0;
            max-width: 20rem;
        }

        .bigbox > article {
            flex: 2 1 0;
            max-width: 40rem;
        }
    }
</style>
